carbonenginejs/tools-blender
===========================

A pure-Python Blender importer and reader for RAD Game Tools' Granny 3D (.gr2)
file format, plus an EVE resource-index browser. Contains no RAD/Granny code
and does not link granny2.dll. Section decompression is reimplemented from
clean-room / open reverse-engineering efforts, listed below.

