Third-party algorithm provenance
--------------------------------

Oodle1 / Oodle0 section decompressor (addons/io_scene_carbon_gr2/gr2/codecs.py)
  Ported from the open Granny2 decompressors:
    - nwn2mdk  "gr2_decompress"        (Boost Software License 1.0)
    - arves100/opengr2  "oodle1.c"     (MPL-2.0)   https://github.com/arves100/opengr2
  This is Granny's own legacy codec, not RAD's modern Oodle (Kraken/BitKnit families).

BitKnit / BitKnit2 section decompressor (addons/io_scene_carbon_gr2/gr2/codecs.py)
  Ported from:
    - neptuwunium/Knit  "GrannyBitKnitCompression.cs"  (EUPL-1.2, sublicensing
      eiz/pybg3's clean-room rANS implementation under MIT)
      https://github.com/neptuwunium/Knit  -  https://github.com/eiz/pybg3
  Cross-checked against powzix/ooz "bitknit.cpp".

Granny curve decompression (addons/io_scene_carbon_gr2/gr2/curves.py)
  Adapted from cppctamber's granny extension for ccpwgl2 (src/core/reader/granny/curves).

Container / relocation / type-tree reflection (addons/io_scene_carbon_gr2/gr2/reader.py)
  Original to this project, derived from the on-disk Granny GRN format layout
  (cross-referenced with the Granny SDK headers and the above projects' docs).

Blender import behavior and settings were adapted from cppctamber's original
`blender_gr2_loader.py` importer. The external converter boundary was replaced
with the bundled reader while retaining its import controls and attribution.

EVE resource index and cache behavior
  The Python browser is original code implementing the public CCP-style index
  rows and CDN layout. CarbonEngineJS tools-core's indexing contracts were used
  as a behavioral interoperability reference; no JavaScript source was copied.

